    "detailed_description": "Andalun and Confunia, ruled by the Goddess of Order and Goddess of Chaos.<br />\r\nOne day, the Goddess of Chaos disappears and monster queens appear in Confunia.<br />\r\nTo keep the monster queens in check, Traborn, the leader of the Knights of Order, went on an expedition to Confunia under orders from the Goddess of Order.<br />\r\nThrough the expedition, Traborn personally obtained an oath of loyalty from all the monster queens of Confunia.<br />\r\nHe made himself Overlord of Confunia and signed a peace treaty with the Andalun.<br />\r\nAnd Traborn fell into a deep sleep to control the power he received from the Monster Queens...<br />\r\nWhen he woke up after a long time, the promised peace did not exist.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGather monster queens and rebuild your castle.<br />\r\nYou must take back your power and hold them accountable for not honoring the peace agreement.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Attractive characters<br />\r\n- Interesting story<br />\r\n- Battle through various character combinations<br />\r\n- Fortress reconstruction and side stories for each character",
